    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎你来到「街边的小报亭」，不管你是步行通勤，或骑车，或开车，或坐车，街边的小报亭一直都在你的右侧，欢迎订阅、分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👌 公众号：街边的小报亭</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧣 微博：六十有小闲</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 知识越少，越喜欢评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 人类的痛苦并不相通（过去的痛苦和现在的也不相通）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 王石说：我并不相信人性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 别试图承担不属于你的责任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 行业中映射着时代的脉搏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">39:45</a> 读书的本质是社交，人不一定要读书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 等待并不好，应该一把透支未来，获得瞬间的资历</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的人物有：</span></p><span></span><p><span>许知远、叶准、王石、汪建、王小川、马东、蔡澜、李诞、papi酱、褚时健....</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rook1e,J'san - Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas (feat. j'san)</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈鸿宇 - 理想三旬</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍃 感谢你收听本期播客，祝你今天一切顺利，我们下期见！</span></p>]]></description>
